==Notes==
*Most notably, bosses drop [[tier 2]] set items.
*Blackwing Lair does not reward reputation for any faction.
*Blackwing Lair was involved in the now-removed [[The Scepter of the Shifting Sands quest chain|Scepter of the Shifting Sands quest chain]].

==Patch changes==
*{{Hotfix|date=2014-10-20|bluenote=Resolved an issue where characters in Spirit Form may be unable to interact with the Orb of Command to reenter the Raid instance.}}
